	"title"		"HeaterDefaults - Choose the default Turn on at temperature"
	"description"		"[b]Stop clicking every new heater down from 10 °C.[/b]

New Heating Stoves, Bonfires and Radiators start with the [i]Turn on at[/i] temperature you choose in the Mods settings menu, instead of the game's fixed 10 °C.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]Setting [i]Heaters - default Turn on at (C)[/i] in the Mods menu: -30 to 30 °C in 5° steps (default 0)
[*]Applies to Heating Stoves, Bonfires and Radiators built while the mod is active
[*]Never touches heaters that already exist in your save, or ones you have adjusted yourself
[*]Uses the game's own Turn on at command, the same as the - / + buttons
[*]Event-driven: does nothing until a building is finished, so it costs nothing at high game speeds or in big towns
[/list]

[h2]Source[/h2]
[url=https://github.com/ringuh/whiskerwood-heaterdefaults]GitHub[/url]

Created using the [url=https://github.com/Whiskerwood-Modding/Whiskerwood-Project]Whiskerwood modkit[/url]."
	"changenote"		"First release"
}
